新應用，過往以筆電為主的塑膠件也已切入車用領域。黃明漢認為，綜合機構件明年營收預估持平，若幾個新案子能順利發酵，則有機會翻轉成長。 針對美國期中選舉後的政局變化，黃明漢認為，對神基影響有限，主要是美國已通過明年主要國防預算，後續差異僅在部分追加預算，因此不影響明年專案出貨；至於未來2-3年開發、並已取得認證的產品，同樣不受影響，但後續仍須關注預算執行情況。","sentiment":1,"tags":{"topics":["EPS/獲利","營收","擴產/資本支出","法說/展望","AI/半導體","總經/聯準會"],"bull":["回升","成長","強勢","年增","受惠"],"bear":[],"score":6,"highlights":[],"keywords":["神基","強固型電腦","無人機","筆電","機構件"]},"time":"11/13 19:47"}],"fund":{"code":"1618","rev_month":"11510","rev":347489.0,"rev_mom":-0.7307590123611972,"rev_yoy":29.6997588814488,"rev_cum_yoy":2.1967974895138034,"eps_q":4.04,"eps_year":"115","eps_season":"3","net_income":778127.0,"pe":6.82,"pb":0.97,"yield":5.01,"updated":"2026-11-13 17:58"},"tdcc":{"latest":{"date":"2026-11-06","big1000":52.87,"big400":57.84,"retail":20.89,"holders":21655},"prev":{"date":"2026-10-30","big1000":52.91,"big400":57.77,"retail":20.96,"holders":21733},"d_big1000":-0.04,"d_big400":0.07,"d_retail":-0.07,"d_holders":-78},"weekly":{"bars":[{"time":"2026-07-27","open":38.0,"high":38.8,"low":35.85,"close":38.1,"volume":3320.601},{"time":"2026-08-03","open":38.0,"high":39.45,"low":37.75,"close":38.45,"volume":2525.016},{"time":"2026-08-10","open":39.3,"high":42.2,"low":39.3,"close":41.7,"volume":7755.112999999999},{"time":"2026-08-17","open":40.1,"high":40.25,"low":38.1,"close":39.1,"volume":2973.83},{"time":"2026-08-24","open":39.1,"high":41.2,"low":38.7,"close":40.4,"volume":3265.998},{"time":"2026-08-31","open":40.6,"high":40.6,"low":39.4,"close":39.65,"volume":1692.8919999999998},{"time":"2026-09-07","open":39.95,"high":39.95,"low":38.7,"close":38.8,"volume":1465.7830000000001},{"time":"2026-09-14","open":38.8,"high":39.35,"low":38.45,"close":39.35,"volume":1202.158},{"time":"2026-09-21","open":39.55,"high":39.55,"low":38.5,"close":38.65,"volume":1013.2420000000001},{"time":"2026-09-29","open":38.8,"high":39.25,"low":38.3,"close":39.15,"volume":1094.973},{"time":"2026-10-05","open":39.45,"high":39.45,"low":38.0,"close":38.1,"volume":1883.204},{"time":"2026-10-1